---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Linux">

	<Hero
		title="Linux"
		description="Linux tutorials, command-line tips, scripting, system administration, and practical guides."
	/>

	<section class="content-section">
	<h2>Featured Tutorial</h2>

	<p>
		Start with the essential Linux commands you'll use when working
		in the terminal.
	</p>

	<a class="tutorial-link" href="/linux/essential-commands/">
		Essential Linux Commands for Beginners →
	</a>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<h2>Start Learning Linux</h2>

		<p>
			Linux is an open-source operating system used on servers,
			desktops, development environments, and many other devices.
		</p>

		<p>
			This section of Bytes of Awareness documents what I learn while
			working with Linux, from basic commands to practical system
			administration.
		</p>
	</section>

</BaseLayout>
